<title>UK: Majestic Wine shares set first-day premium.</title>
<headline>Majestic Wine shares set first-day premium.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Majestic Wine Plc set a 24 percent premium on their first day of trading in London Stock Exchange's Alternative Investment Market on Monday.</p>
<p>By 0905 GMT the shares in the wine retailer were quoted at 199-1/2p, up 39-1/2p on the placing price, though no trading was recorded in the stock.</p>
<p>The placing, with Williams de Broe as adviser, raised 4.4 million stg and gave a market capitalisation of 20.4 million stg. Majestic will use the proceeds from the float to fund expansion and to provide additional working capital.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7945</p>
</text>
